      "oneLine": "Kharvathen is centered at -2.057905, -44.076840 under Oligarchy, with 143,961,000 people across 9 settlements.",
      "extremeAtlasDescription": "Kharvathen occupies  sq mi /  sq km of modeled Earth-sized territory. Its province terrain is led by Mountain range, Deep cavern, Grassland. Dorghalun and Rivenwild carry the mountain record: Dorghalun is deep mountain, and Rivenwild is a hybrid settlement partly perched on a mountain side.",
